<title>USA: Conair sets 4-for-1 stock split.</title>
<headline>Conair sets 4-for-1 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>GARDEN CITY PARK, N.Y. 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Conair Corp said its board of directors has declared a four-for-one stock split, subject to shareholder approval, to shareholders of record January 3, payable January 17.</p>
</text>
